#### 250",,243,"Jason got a phone plan of 1000 minutes every month. Every day, he talk 15 minutes with his boss, and this month he also talk extra 300 minutes with other folks. If this month got 30 days, how many minutes Jason still got?","Jason has a phone plan of 1000 minutes per month. Every day he has a 15-minute call with his boss, and he's had 300 extra minutes of call this month to other people. How many minutes does Jason have left if this month has 30 days?",250,250,"To find out how many minutes Jason still has, we need to calculate how many minutes he has used.
